    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2253070/extras/d2f2922f0cd57ef0aad7ba71aa41cce5.avif?t=1724734361\" /></span><br><br><strong><i>A vicious disease engulfs the war-torn isle of Falcia, plunging its victims into what seems to be a shared delirium. Fate entwines a crippled Church-Guard with a Fallen Angel, and together they resolve to face the new threat by any and all means.</i></strong>",
